@startuml
title Case Scoring And Checkpoint - Detail

skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

participant Runner
participant "Target model" as Target
participant "Local judge" as Judge
database "Evaluation run" as Output

Runner -> Target : case prompt + context
Target --> Runner : prediction
Runner -> Judge : prediction + answer key + rubric
Judge --> Runner : validated CaseScore
Runner -> Output : replace predictions
Runner -> Output : replace case results
Runner -> Output : replace aggregate scores
Runner -> Output : replace manifest last

note right of Output
Four atomic replacements,
not one transaction.
end note

@enduml
